WEBVTT

00:41:29.275 --> 00:41:32.484
So, it's not something
I can just do lightly,

00:41:32.508 --> 00:41:35.382
whereas he would love to have
the house full of people a lot.

00:41:35.406 --> 00:41:38.159
And so, you know,
we just kind of work it out

00:41:38.183 --> 00:41:39.992
and try to establish a balance.

00:41:40.016 --> 00:41:43.718
I have met couples where
that's a real issue for them,

00:41:43.742 --> 00:41:45.771
and I often would say to them

00:41:45.795 --> 00:41:48.739
to try to kind of come up
with a quota system in advance

00:41:48.763 --> 00:41:51.167
of how often are you
going to invite guests over,

00:41:51.191 --> 00:41:52.966
how often are you going to go out --

00:41:52.990 --> 00:41:57.571
kind of negotiate it one time, so that you
don't have to do it over and over again.

00:41:57.595 --> 00:42:01.084
CA: I'm also married
to an amazing extrovert.